{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，杜如風（Helen）挑戰小型飛機體驗，畏高的她竟在登機前嚇到致電母親講定遺言！面對僅500港元的超值體驗，她一度三心兩意，質疑事前準備太兒戲，最終能否衝破心理關口，場面爆笑連場！\n</p>\n<h2>登機前嚇到彈出彈入 杜如風爆笑致電阿媽講遺言</h2>\n<p>在走訪小型飛機飛行學院時，一向天不怕地不怕的杜如風竟因畏高而表現得相當抗拒。面對僅500港元就能體驗駕駛小型飛機的機會，她卻三心兩意、彈出彈入，更質疑體驗過程的事前準備功夫太「兒戲」。在極度驚青的狀態下，她更搞笑地致電媽媽講遺言：「我銀行儲低啲錢，你同我使晒佢就得啦！」與工作人員經過多個回合的拉鋸，場面令人哭笑不得。</p>\n<h2>500蚊體驗衝上雲霄 杜如風克服恐懼變燦爛細路女</h2>\n<p>經過一番心理掙扎，杜如風最終鼓起勇氣衝上雲霄！起飛後，她一掃臨上機前的驚青樣，全程恍如孩子般笑容燦爛，更興奮地不停影相拍片。在專業駕駛員的指導下，她更親身體驗扭軚及俯衝等動作，安全又好玩。這次體驗價錢僅500港元，不但可以隨意拍片，還能在專業指導下感受駕駛樂趣，可謂「抵到爛」，與她登機前的恐懼形成極大對比。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到爆笑：Helen啲反應好真實！</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，杜如風的真實反應引來網民熱議，紛紛留言大讚夠貼地。有網民表示：「500蚊可以揸飛機真係抵到爛！好想試！」、「嚇到講遺言笑死我，杜如風果然係杜如風！」、「睇佢由驚到Enjoy個樣，好治癒！」、「呢個體驗好似好正，已bookmark！」<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_15505138966afbe2904a0cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_15505138966afbe2904a0cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>（圖片來源：TVB）<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20593363556afbe28be060b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20593363556afbe28be060b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>（圖片來源：TVB）</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_5875842566afbe275d6e27.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_5875842566afbe275d6e27.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_10308621996afbe27a415b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_10308621996afbe27a415b2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_4422277516afbe27fd6ddc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_4422277516afbe27fd6ddc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10074554226afbe28522c7a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10074554226afbe28522c7a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14137988276afbe2950f089.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14137988276afbe2950f089.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_6641761776afbe299564d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_6641761776afbe299564d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_13144006306afbe29dae559.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_13144006306afbe29dae559.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15175382976afbe2a3844c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_15175382976afbe2a3844c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9687614096afbe2a88e2f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9687614096afbe2a88e2f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.498931+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":949,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:30:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:48:20.384244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:53.706579+00:00","content_hash":"bc28865e51de9637fc402c3a478d3492761036b28dffd21ed336eceb8ae0fbd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}